Package: otrail-screen
Version: 0.4.17
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, x11vnc, wmctrl, adb
Maintainer: oTraiL contributors
Description: Share a Linux X11 window with the oTraiL Android app over USB
 Installs a per-user command-line manager for a localhost-only VNC session,
 selected X11 window, and ADB reverse tunnel to one authorized Android device.
